cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PSD-Metacommunity-Dispersal_AI: MetaDiffusion for process-aware species-distribution reconstruction"
abstract: >-
  A two-stage pipeline for process-aware species-distribution modelling with
  uncertainty. Stage 1 is a Lotka-Volterra individual-based metacommunity
  simulation; Stage 2 ("MetaDiffusion") is a conditional diffusion model that
  reconstructs full species range maps, with ensemble-based uncertainty, from a
  handful of records - with a focus on rare, range-restricted species.
